=== WORKSPACE switching ("Circuit Switching") ===
TABS: []
BUTTONS (1): ["Establish Circuit"]
TEXT HEAD:
Circuit Switching
Connection-oriented switching: setup reserves a dedicated data rate on every link of the routed path, admission control blocks requests that cannot be fully satisfied, and teardown releases the capacity. Distinct from the packet engine, where each packet is forwarded independently.
Model: hop-count shortest path
Reservations: shared per link
